    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "Because [`XCUIElement`](xcuielement.md) conforms to the [`XCUIElementTypeQueryProvider`](xcuielementtypequeryprovider.md) protocol, you can use the protocol’s properties as shorthand for calling [`descendants(matching:)`](xcuielement/descendants(matching:).md) for different element types.",
      "normalizedSource": "Because [`XCUIElement`](xcuielement.md) conforms to the [`XCUIElementTypeQueryProvider`](xcuielementtypequeryprovider.md) protocol, you can use the protocol’s properties as shorthand for calling [`descendants(matching:)`](xcuielement/descendants(matching:).md) for different element types.",
      "sourceHash": "9820909fdf290c75f3f7101434076d12e2e9c533bb888245cc3fb86f12f7a654",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "For example, rather than calling `table.descendants(matching: .cell)`, you can use the [`cells`](xcuielementtypequeryprovider/cells.md) property from the protocol to retrieve `table.cells`.",
      "documentTitle": "descendants(matching:)",
